// lexdb_exec: percentile_cont and percentile_disc, checked against PostgreSQL 18
// (generated by tests/lexdb/gen_pg.py from pct_queries.txt): the ordered-set aggregates
// over integers, numerics, doubles, texts, dates, timestamps and intervals, DESC and
// NULLS, fractions 0 to 1, even and odd counts, ties, NULLs, one row and none, groups of
// thousands of rows, FILTER, HAVING, a fraction per group, a correlated subquery, the result
// types, and the errors (22003 outside 0 and 1, 42883 for a type or arguments, 42809 without
// WITHIN GROUP, 0A000 with OVER: PostgreSQL has no window form).
